<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐανθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blooming, downy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκάσαι τε γένυς εὐανθέϊ λάχνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.320
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rich in flowers, flowery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1200
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλποι λειμώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					373
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					196b
				</span></i>
			; <i>decked with flowers</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				78
			</span></i>; <i>freely flowering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flowered, gay-coloured, gay, bright</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					100d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				792a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				794b5
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβοι αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					621
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				575
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρωμναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.639
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαφαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.250
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.51a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ. τοῦ ὄρνιθος</span> its
				<i>bright colours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.399a
			</span></i>; <i>pink, flushed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.100
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>blooming, fresh, goodly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					5(4).12
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλικία</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				7(6).34
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>O.</u>
				6.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1002
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ὀργά</span> a <i>goodly,
				noble</i> temper, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.89
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἅλμῃ . .
			εὐανθεστέρᾳ</span> in <i>fresher</i> brine, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.Com.
				1.21
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εστάτη ἡλικία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.120a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
